<title>HUNGARY: HUNGARY 3-MO BUBOR RATE UP BUT ONE-, SIX-MO FLAT.</title>
<headline>HUNGARY 3-MO BUBOR RATE UP BUT ONE-, SIX-MO FLAT.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's Budapest Interbank Offered Rates (BUBOR) edged up for the three-month maturity but was steady for one- and six-month rates on Monday, the National Bank of Hungary said on its  BUBOR Reuters page.</p>
<p>The one-month rate was fixed at 20.50 percent, unchanged, the three-month rate at 20.12 percent, up 0.01 and the six-month rate at 19.75 percent, unchanged.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327 4040</p>
</text>
